From 5c1e2531257784c81a9b379627ef545144c159ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@accounts.eddster.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:54:34 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] offline: replace Firebase and excalidraw.com backends
 with same-origin HTTP storage

Endpoints, all relative to the app origin (no build-time configuration):
- socket.io collab: /socket.io/ (socket.io-client with no URL)
- share links: POST /api/v2/post/, GET /api/v2/<id>
- room scenes: GET/PUT /api/scenes/<roomId> (JSON {sceneVersion, iv, ciphertext}, base64)
- files: GET/PUT /api/files/<rooms|shareLinks>/<id>/<fileId> (octet-stream)

The vite dev server proxies /api, /socket.io (websocket) and /libraries to
the offline server on localhost:3000.

Removes the firebase dependency and the Excalidraw+ export component (it
required Firebase storage; the rest of Excalidraw+ goes in a later patch).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
